req	Level 20 Thieving
step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Speak to <col=800000>Tomas Lawry</col> outside the <col=800000>Port Piscarilius</col> bank. (Grab a <col=800000>bowl</col> from the <col=800000>general store</col> on your way to the bank if you plan on making the <col=800000>stew</col> yourself.)</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Speak to Tomas Lawry outside the Port Piscarilius bank. (Grab a bowl from the general store on your way to the bank if you plan on making the stew yourself.)</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Head south and speak to <col=800000>Robert O'Reilly</col> in the house directly west of the bridge. He will ask for a <col=800000>stew</col>. A <col=800000>stew</col> can be made with <col=800000>raw beef</col> and a <col=800000>potato</col> purchased from <col=800000>Kenelme</col> directly west along with a <col=800000>bowl</col> from the general store south-east.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Speak to Tomas Lawry outside the Port Piscarilius bank. (Grab a bowl from the general store on your way to the bank if you plan on making the stew yourself.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Head south and speak to Robert O'Reilly in the house directly west of the bridge. He will ask for a stew. A stew can be made with raw beef and a potato purchased from Kenelme directly west along with a bowl from the general store south-east.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Enter the <col=800000>manhole</col> to the east marked by the <col=800000>File:Dungeon map link icon.png</col> icon, cross the bridge a bit to the south, continue west.</col>
